@startuml enterprise-context
' Logical capability view; not a deployment topology or approved interface contract.
!include ../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/package-diagram-style.iuml
title Enterprise Technology Operations - Proposed Capability Boundaries
left to right direction

actor "Platform Operator" as Operator
actor "Security and Risk Owner" as Risk
actor "Delivery Team" as Delivery

package "Enterprise Technology Operations" {
  rectangle "Identity Federation\nAuthentik or approved IdP" as Identity
  rectangle "Security Findings\nSAST / DAST / IAST / Trivy / SBOM" as Findings
  rectangle "ITAM and ITSM\nGLPI / iTop" as Service
  rectangle "Risk and Evidence\nEramba / Evidence Vault" as Governance
  rectangle "Work Management\nTaiga / Moodle / SuiteCRM" as Work
  rectangle "Isolated Finance Zone\nGnuCash / Actual / Firefly / Ghostfolio" as Finance
}

Delivery --> Findings : approved scan results
Operator --> Service : service operations
Risk --> Governance : controls and decisions
Findings --> Service : scoped asset lookup
Findings --> Work : remediation reference
Findings --> Governance : verified evidence
Identity ..> Service : approved federation
Identity ..> Governance : approved federation
Identity ..> Work : approved federation
Finance ..> Governance : approved aggregate only

note right of Finance
  Raw transactions and ledgers stay inside
  the separately governed finance boundary.
end note
@enduml
